# --- H4: Security Hardening - Apache Configuration ---

# The 'ServerTokens Prod' directive is not allowed in .htaccess files and
# must be set in the main server configuration (e.g., httpd.conf).
# Leaving it here causes a 500 Internal Server Error.

# Hide server version information from server-generated error pages.
ServerSignature Off

# B2: prevent directory listing anywhere under the document root
# (previously only enforced inside images/.htaccess).
Options -Indexes